            "description": "\u2605 Store a card once, charge it again later without the buyer re-entering it.\n\nNote it uses the TOKENISATION account (TKA_), not transaction processing. Then charge it with payment_method: { id: \"{{payment_method_id}}\" } instead of a card object.",
